0084:     - From the chosen start vertex, copy adjacent shadow offsets along each drawable edge
0085:       when the parallel path is in bounds and clear.
0086: 
0087:     Key insight: The main outline is reconstructed first, then the start vertex's neighbor offsets define parallel shadow strokes.
