0119:     - Paint yellow diagonal ribbons from the top, left, bottom, and right side centers in a clockwise pinwheel: NE, NW, SW, and SE.
0120:     - A yellow ribbon alternates a single center cell with a three-cell horizontal or vertical slice; a blocker encountered within a slice stops the ribbon after any earlier cells in that slice are painted.
